# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# MiForge Harness: Claude Code (official Anthropic CLI via proxy)
# Routes Claude Code through LiteLLM → free providers.
# Claude Code thinks it's talking to Anthropic. It's not.
#
# Usage: source harnesses/claude-code.env && claude
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Redirect Anthropic endpoint to local LiteLLM proxy ──
ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=miforge-local-dev

# ── Alternative: Point directly to fcc-server (port 8082) ──
# ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8082
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=not-needed

# ── Claude Code Settings ──
# Skip permission prompts for automation (use with safety gates!)
# claude --dangerously-skip-permissions

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ⚠️  SECURITY WARNING (from master doc):
# Always use Claude Code v2.0.65+ (pre-v2.0.65 has ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL
# injection vulnerability). Verify with: claude --version
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
